## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8 Flash
- **Short description:** Alibaba's fast-tier Qwen 3.8 model (released Aug 26, 2026). 1M context (991,808 input / 131,072 output), text/image/video input, text output; multi-tool calling, long context, low cost ($0.15/$0.47 or China $0.113/$0.382).
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (`qwen3.8-flash`) / QwenCloud API. OpenAI/Anthropic compatible. Free tier possible via token quotas, not confirmed in sampled docs.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-08-26 (GA); knowledge cutoff not published in sampled docs.
- **IDs:** `qwen3.8-flash` (Alibaba)
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (991,808 input / 131,072 output). Verified via Alibaba docs.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video in; text out. Function calling, structured output, partial mode, context cache, batch (China only?).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** China $0.113/$0.382 per 1M; International $0.15/$0.47. Cache reads cheaper.
- **Architecture:** MoE (Qwen3.8 Flash; details not in sampled docs beyond model description). Open weights status? Qwen 3.8-27B and 2.4T are public; base Flash likely proprietary endpoint (not verified open).

